sequenceDiagram
    actor O as Service Officer
    participant App as CampusServiceApp
    participant M as ServiceRequestManager
    participant SR as ServiceRequest (e.g. ICTSupportRequest)
    O->>App: Choose "10. Service Officer Menu" → "Assign a Technician"
    App->>O: Ask for officer ID, request ID, Technician ID
    O->>App: OFF001, REQ001, TECH001
    App->>M: assignTechnician("REQ001", "OFF001", "TECH001")
    M->>M: findRequestById / findUserById (officer, technician)
    alt request, officer or technician not found
        M-->>App: throws "Request not found." / "Technician not found."
        App-->>O: Error message
    else all found
        M->>SR: assignTechnician(officer, technician)
        SR->>SR: officer instanceof ServiceOfficer?
        SR->>SR: technician instanceof Technician?
        SR->>SR: private checkTransition(Assigned) — is current status Reviewed?
        alt not allowed
            SR-->>M: throws e.g. "Only a Service Officer can assign a Technician."
            M-->>App: error
            App-->>O: Error message (request unchanged)
        else allowed
            SR->>SR: set private assignedTechnician = technician
            SR->>SR: private changeStatus(Assigned) → add history entry
            SR-->>M: done
            M-->>App: request
            App-->>O: "Done. REQ001 is now Assigned."
        end
    end
